@page "/"
@** The showcase's home: what this site is, and the components' index. *@
@import { Typography } from "@tsazor/bootstrap"

<Typography Variant="h1">Tsazor components</Typography>
<Typography>
    Live demos of the Tsazor component library in the Bootstrap skin, each beside the .tsazor source it runs —
    the code a copy button puts on your clipboard (the Radzen and Blazorise demo sites do this the same way).
    The same set of demos runs against the Fluent skin in the skins app.
</Typography>

<section class="sz-cards">
    <a class="sz-card" href="/datagrid">
        <strong>DataGrid</strong>
        <span>Columns, sorting, paging, an ItemsProvider, selection, the built-in filter, density, aggregates, resize and order, editing, grouping, persistence, export.</span>
    </a>
    <a class="sz-card" href="/richtext">
        <strong>RichText</strong>
        <span>An external engine's wrapper: value in and out as HTML, sanitize on read, the engine stays the app's.</span>
    </a>
    <a class="sz-card" href="/schedule">
        <strong>Scheduler</strong>
        <span>Month, week and day views; all-day rows; overlapping timed appointments in lanes.</span>
    </a>
    <a class="sz-card" href="/chat">
        <strong>Chat</strong>
        <span>A state that streams, the roles' bubbles, Markdown in the answers; the provider stays the app's.</span>
    </a>
</section>